      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRINZINGER LASS (4) has found that winning touch again down in grade at her last 2 starts here, and with the return to some better company, she will carry 2.5kg less this time. The hat-trick beckons. LIMITED RISK (2) just peaked on his run late here last time out 3 weeks ago, and he will be fully fit at his third run back from a spell after a recent freshen up. His record over 1400m is strong, and he can go one better here. HEMAN (1) has been bought out of Queensland after failing to fire there last season. A change of scenery can work wonders for the older geldings, and with a bunch of gear changes since his last run, a form reversal would be no surprise. Follow the market moves. FLYING START (3) hardly runs a bad race here when fit, and he has been holding his form all season. He is down in weight, and is a must for all top 4 combos. PRINCESS PANCAKES (5) is another consistent veteran mare who has been racing as well as ever. She steps up to her pet trip, and can take this out.",
